{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_3100_p", "source_sha256": "97058263a85e9bd0366f6c17f5a1e5324e69b146457684e773fa7f1831277d2e", "ja": "そうだな……卵なんてどうだ？\n色も白と黄色だし、簡単だろう？", "zh": "这个嘛……画一颗蛋如何？\n颜色也只有白色和黄色，很简单吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
