{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_3000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_3102_015siz", "source_sha256": "6758808166f6e2bd22891c76d85d388c99969629413c2a2303bb6f65fef2009d", "ja": "あ、でもせっかくのクイズ番組なんだし、少しくらい\n工夫を……{$P$}？　どうしました？", "zh": "啊，不过难得上猜谜节目，再多少下点工夫……\n{$P$}？你怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
